          "skill": "form-structure-and-sense",
          "passage": "Anthropologist Kim TallBear teaches at the University of Alberta, where she examines how consumer ancestry tests shape ideas about Native American identity. ______ that tribal belonging is constituted by political and kinship relations rather than genetic markers, TallBear argues in her 2013 book Native American DNA that consumer DNA tests miscategorize tribal citizenship as a biological rather than political matter.",
